  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The camera is a pretty good tool already but maybe it could use a bit more features for content creators. I, myself, am a rather small one who makes some music videos in games like GTA 5 in which there is a very nice editor with camera movement and so on. While VRChat already has stuff like \"World Space\" or \"Follow User\" options, a steady cam for shaky hands and so on, I would still love if there was a camera movement option so that we would be able to make the camera move on certain keyframes (or whatever you want to call them) around the world space and change how fast it would move. This would allow for even cooler possibilities on how to make VRChat videos! Maybe someone else already thought about this but I would love to have at least this one feature.",
